{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"nav":1},[2,31],{"label":3,"items":4},"Start",[5,21],{"title":6,"path":7,"headings":8},"Getting started","/docs/getting-started",[9,12,15,18],{"id":10,"text":11},"open-scratch","Open Scratch",{"id":13,"text":14},"add-five-numbers","Add five numbers",{"id":16,"text":17},"change-the-shortcuts","Change the shortcuts",{"id":19,"text":20},"choose-the-look-and-motion","Choose the look and motion",{"title":22,"path":23,"headings":24},"Keyboard Shortcuts","/docs/shortcuts",[25,28],{"id":26,"text":27},"switch-sheets","Switch sheets",{"id":29,"text":30},"nudge-a-number-or-date","Nudge a number or date",{"label":32,"items":33},"Guides",[34,113,129,166,182,192],{"title":35,"path":36,"headings":37},"Grid and shortcuts","/docs/grid",[38,41,44,47,50,53,56,59,62,65,68,71,74,77,80,83,86,89,92,95,98,101,104,107,110],{"id":39,"text":40},"grid-toolbar","Grid toolbar",{"id":42,"text":43},"move-and-select","Move and select",{"id":45,"text":46},"complete-a-formula","Complete a formula",{"id":48,"text":49},"select-separate-ranges","Select separate ranges",{"id":51,"text":52},"save-a-named-range","Save a named range",{"id":54,"text":55},"named-tables","Named tables",{"id":57,"text":58},"add-borders-or-style-a-table","Add borders or style a table",{"id":60,"text":61},"duplicate-a-sheet-or-import-a-file","Duplicate a sheet or import a file",{"id":63,"text":64},"insert-or-delete-rows-and-columns","Insert or delete rows and columns",{"id":66,"text":67},"move-hide-or-resize-rows-and-columns","Move, hide or resize rows and columns",{"id":69,"text":70},"freeze-rows-and-columns","Freeze rows and columns",{"id":72,"text":73},"sort-rows","Sort rows",{"id":75,"text":76},"filter-rows","Filter rows",{"id":78,"text":79},"resize-the-window","Resize the window",{"id":81,"text":82},"move-or-detach-panes","Move or detach panes",{"id":84,"text":85},"open-a-sheet-in-its-own-window","Open a sheet in its own window",{"id":87,"text":88},"drag-out-a-table-or-export-csv","Drag out a table or export CSV",{"id":90,"text":91},"copy-a-range-for-another-app","Copy a range for another app",{"id":93,"text":94},"workbooks-and-sheet-archive","Workbooks and sheet archive",{"id":96,"text":97},"tsv-and-excel-files","TSV and Excel files",{"id":99,"text":100},"preview-paste-and-fill","Preview paste and fill",{"id":102,"text":103},"format-a-range","Format a range",{"id":105,"text":106},"calculate-and-copy","Calculate and copy",{"id":108,"text":109},"work-across-sheets","Work across sheets",{"id":111,"text":112},"check-inputs-as-you-edit","Check inputs as you edit",{"title":114,"path":115,"headings":116},"Capture and paste","/docs/capture",[117,120,123,126],{"id":118,"text":119},"capture-amounts","Capture amounts",{"id":121,"text":122},"read-a-screenshot","Read a screenshot",{"id":124,"text":125},"choose-how-to-paste","Choose how to paste",{"id":127,"text":128},"fill-a-series","Fill a series",{"title":130,"path":131,"headings":132},"Notes and Obsidian","/docs/notes-and-obsidian",[133,136,139,142,145,148,151,154,157,160,163],{"id":134,"text":135},"move-notes","Move Notes",{"id":137,"text":138},"resize-notes","Resize Notes",{"id":140,"text":141},"format-a-note","Format a note",{"id":143,"text":144},"annotate-a-cell-or-range","Annotate a cell or range",{"id":146,"text":147},"put-a-live-result-in-a-note","Put a live result in a note",{"id":149,"text":150},"repair-a-note-link","Repair a note link",{"id":152,"text":153},"send-the-table-and-notes","Send the table and notes",{"id":155,"text":156},"save-a-dated-sheet-note","Save a dated sheet note",{"id":158,"text":159},"edit-a-table-in-both-scratch-and-obsidian","Edit a table in both Scratch and Obsidian",{"id":161,"text":162},"open-an-export-in-scratch","Open an export in Scratch",{"id":164,"text":165},"search-your-obsidian-vault","Search your Obsidian vault",{"title":167,"path":168,"headings":169},"Formula Microscope","/docs/formula-microscope",[170,173,176,179],{"id":171,"text":172},"read-a-calculation","Read a calculation",{"id":174,"text":175},"find-a-cell-behind-an-error","Find a cell behind an error",{"id":177,"text":178},"match-formula-references-to-the-grid","Match formula references to the grid",{"id":180,"text":181},"see-where-a-pinned-result-came-from","See where a pinned result came from",{"title":183,"path":184,"headings":185},"Selection History","/docs/history",[186,189],{"id":187,"text":188},"compare-a-revision","Compare a revision",{"id":190,"text":191},"restore-just-the-range","Restore just the range",{"title":193,"path":194,"headings":195},"Record and Replay","/docs/replay",[196],{"id":197,"text":198},"try-it-on-another-range","Try it on another range"],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"doc":1,"prev":7,"next":10},{"title":2,"description":3,"html":4,"path":5,"group":6},"Capture and paste","Bring in clipboard amounts, screenshots and delimited text.","\u003Cp class=\"lead\">Copy amounts or an image in another app and press ⌥⇧ Space with Scratch running. Scratch opens a new sheet for the capture.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"capture-amounts\">Capture amounts\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#capture-amounts\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Copy a column of numbers or lines such as \u003Ccode>Lunch $12.50\u003C/code>. The new sheet includes a live total. Press ⇧⌘C to copy the total or ⇧⌘J to send the table and notes to Obsidian.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"scratch-media\">\n\u003Cvideo class=\"scratch-light\" controls muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Copied café amounts become a Scratch sheet with a calculated total of 29.80.\" poster=\"/docs/clipboard-total-light.webp\" width=\"1120\" height=\"780\">\n\u003Csource src=\"/docs/capture-demo-light.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n\u003C/video>\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-light scratch-poster\" src=\"/docs/clipboard-total-light.webp\" alt=\"Copied café amounts become a Scratch sheet with a calculated total of 29.80.\" width=\"1120\" height=\"780\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003Cvideo class=\"scratch-dark\" controls muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Copied café amounts become a Scratch sheet with a calculated total of 29.80.\" poster=\"/docs/clipboard-total-dark.webp\" width=\"1120\" height=\"780\">\n\u003Csource src=\"/docs/capture-demo-dark.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n\u003C/video>\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-dark scratch-poster\" src=\"/docs/clipboard-total-dark.webp\" alt=\"Copied café amounts become a Scratch sheet with a calculated total of 29.80.\" width=\"1120\" height=\"780\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003C/figure>\u003Ch2 id=\"read-a-screenshot\">Read a screenshot\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#read-a-screenshot\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Use ⌃⇧⌘4 to copy a region of the screen. Press ⌥⇧ Space or paste the image with ⌘V in Scratch. Apple Vision reads the screenshot on your Mac. Scratch uses the rightmost amount it recognises in each row. Crop to the amount column if the screenshot has several.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Select a row to inspect its amount beside its source crop in \u003Cstrong>Review Capture\u003C/strong>. Press ⌘U to toggle the pane. Use the left and right chevrons to visit uncertain rows first, then the remaining unchecked rows. Correct any amount in the grid, then click \u003Cstrong>Mark Correct\u003C/strong>. Editing a reviewed row puts it back in review.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Scratch shows the sum of the detail rows and compares it with a recognised printed total. The pane shows the difference when they disagree. Mixed currencies and invalid amounts leave the calculated total unavailable. The source image and review marks are saved with the workbook.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Click \u003Cstrong>Append\u003C/strong>, choose another sheet, then enter the destination columns in item and amount order, with a currency column if the capture has one. For example, enter \u003Ccode>B, D\u003C/code> to put items in B and amounts in D. Scratch previews the range below the last populated row in those columns and remembers the mapping for that sheet. Only reviewed detail rows append. The source capture remains available, and ⌘Z undoes the append as one edit.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"scratch-media\">\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-light\" src=\"/docs/receipt-review-light.webp\" alt=\"The Harbour Kitchen receipt sits beside its recognised rows. Scratch compares the printed and calculated totals.\" width=\"1520\" height=\"840\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-dark\" src=\"/docs/receipt-review-dark.webp\" alt=\"The Harbour Kitchen receipt sits beside its recognised rows. Scratch compares the printed and calculated totals.\" width=\"1520\" height=\"840\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003C/figure>\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-to-paste\">Choose how to paste\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#choose-how-to-paste\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Open \u003Cstrong>Command Palette\u003C/strong> from the ⋯ menu or press its shortcut (⇧⌘P by default). \u003Cstrong>Paste Values\u003C/strong> copies the displayed values into the destination. \u003Cstrong>Paste Formulas Only\u003C/strong> and \u003Cstrong>Paste Formatting Only\u003C/strong> use cells copied in Scratch.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Choose \u003Cstrong>Preview Paste\u003C/strong> to inspect the destination and dimensions in the bar above the grid. The preview leaves the grid in place. Cells that will be replaced are highlighted. Click another cell or use the arrows to move the preview. Choose \u003Cstrong>Values\u003C/strong>, \u003Cstrong>Formulas\u003C/strong>, \u003Cstrong>Transpose\u003C/strong> or \u003Cstrong>Split\u003C/strong>, or press 1 through 4. In Split, choose a separator or press S to cycle through them. Values and Split preserve leading zeros. Return or \u003Cstrong>Paste\u003C/strong> applies the preview and Escape cancels it.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Choose \u003Cstrong>Preview Paste CSV\u003C/strong>, \u003Cstrong>Preview Paste TSV\u003C/strong> or \u003Cstrong>Preview Paste Semicolon\u003C/strong> to inspect a destination before writing. Press T to treat fields as text, D to interpret decimal commas, Return to paste or Escape to cancel. Use text mode for IDs with leading zeros.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fill-a-series\">Fill a series\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fill-a-series\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Select the starting cells and drag the small square at the bottom right of the selection. You can also choose a \u003Cstrong>Preview Fill\u003C/strong> command and extend with the arrows before pressing Return. Scratch extends regular number, date and weekday series and shifts relative references when filling formulas.\u003C/p>\n","/docs/capture","Guides",{"title":8,"path":9},"Grid and shortcuts","/docs/grid",{"title":11,"path":12},"Notes and Obsidian","/docs/notes-and-obsidian"],"uses":{"params":["page"]}}]}
